---
// Guarantee.astro
---

<section class="guarantee">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="guarantee-inner">
      <div class="guarantee-left reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">The guarantee</span>
        <div class="g-number">90<sup>D</sup></div>
        <div class="g-label">Days to Top 3 or Full Refund</div>
      </div>

      <div class="guarantee-right reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <h2 class="g-headline">
          We put <em>$1,500</em> on the line<br/>so you don't have to.
        </h2>
        <p class="g-body">
          Every other agency asks you to trust them with your money and hope for the best. We flip the script. If you're not in the top 3 on Google Maps within 90 days, we give every dollar back — no hassle, no fine print.
        </p>
        <div class="g-promise">
          <div class="g-promise-item">
            <svg class="g-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            <p><span>Top 3 in 90 days</span> or we refund your full $1,500. Written into the agreement.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="g-promise-item">
            <svg class="g-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
            <p>We're not worried about giving refunds. <span>We don't plan on it.</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
